From: Isaac Forge <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Replace removed ament_target_dependencies()

ament_cmake 2.8.6 removed ament_target_dependencies() (ament/ament_cmake#614), so this
no longer configures on ROS 2 Lyrical. ament_cmake_auto's
ament_auto_depend_on_packages() is its replacement: it links ${<pkg>_TARGETS} where a
package exports targets and falls back to <pkg>_INCLUDE_DIRS/_LIBRARIES otherwise, which
isaac_ros_common still needs. Without SCOPE it uses the plain target_link_libraries()
signature, matching the other calls on these targets.
---
--- a/vda5050_action_handler_plugins/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/vda5050_action_handler_plugins/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -76,7 +76,7 @@
 
 target_compile_definitions(vda5050_action_handler_plugins PUBLIC "PLUGINLIB__DISABLE_BOOST_FUNCTIONS")
 
-ament_target_dependencies(vda5050_action_handler_plugins
+ament_auto_depend_on_packages(vda5050_action_handler_plugins PACKAGES
   ${dependencies}
 )
 
@@ -106,7 +106,7 @@
 
   ament_add_gtest(test_plugin_registration test/test_plugin_registration.cpp)
   if(TARGET test_plugin_registration)
-    ament_target_dependencies(test_plugin_registration
+    ament_auto_depend_on_packages(test_plugin_registration PACKAGES
       class_loader
       pluginlib
       vda5050_action_handler
